flowchart TB
    Browser["<b>Browser</b><br/>(member / admin UI)"]

    NPM["<b>nginx-proxy-manager</b><br/>(VPS, TLS termination)"]

    App["<b>Next.js App</b><br/>(app)"]

    SaaS["<b>External SaaS</b><br/>─────────────────────<br/>
Clerk &lt;--&gt; verify session / webhooks<br/>
Stripe &lt;--&gt; charges / webhook events<br/>
Resend &lt;--&gt; send transactional email<br/>
Google Cal / Meet API --&gt; OAuth + create event/Meet link"]

    DataTier["<b>Data Tier</b><br/>─────────────────────<br/>
Postgres &lt;-- SQL reads/writes<br/>
Redis &lt;-- jobs, sessions, rate-limit cache<br/>
Meilisearch &lt;-- search index/query<br/>
MinIO (S3) &lt;-- object get/put: avatars, recordings"]

    Worker["<b>Worker container</b><br/>(background jobs + Google<br/>Calendar recording-sync sweep)"]

    Conferencing["<b>Conferencing</b><br/>─────────────────────<br/>
Browser (participants) &lt;--&gt; WebRTC audio/video --&gt; LiveKit server<br/>
LiveKit server --&gt; recording start/stop (RPC) --&gt; LiveKit Egress<br/>
LiveKit Egress --&gt; recording file upload (S3 API) --&gt; MinIO above"]

    Observability["<b>Observability (VPS host)</b><br/>─────────────────────<br/>
node-exporter --&gt; scrape host metrics<br/>
Prometheus --&gt; query metrics<br/>
Grafana (dashboards)<br/>
─────────────────────<br/>
(separate stack; not wired into the app itself)"]

    Browser -->|"HTTPS: pages, forms, API calls"| NPM
    NPM -->|"HTTP: proxied requests"| App
    App --> SaaS
    SaaS --> DataTier
    DataTier -->|"shares Postgres/Redis/Meilisearch above"| Worker
    Worker -->|"App: create room / issue join token"| Conferencing
    Conferencing ~~~ Observability
